<!-- 
| Feature/Gaps           | Status    | Technical Observation                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
| **Register Map**       | **FULL**  | Populated strictly according to `hbn_reg.h`. Covers the complete Always-On (AON) power domain and Hibernate control logic.                                                                                                                                                             |
| **Base Address**       | Explicit  | 0x2000F000.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| **RTC & Hibernate**    | **FULL**  | Integrated Hibernate Timer (0x04-0x08) and RTC Latch mechanism (0x0C-0x10). `RTC_TIME_H` bit 31 acts as the trigger for latching the 64-bit counter.                                                                                                                                    |
| **Power Domain**       | **FULL**  | `HBN_CTL` (0x00) and `HBN_GLB` (0x30) provide deep control over LDO11 voltages, DCDC modes, and Power-Down/Trap states.                                                                                                                                                                |
| **PIR & BOR**          | **FULL**  | Added Passive Infra-Red (0x20-0x28) and Brown-Out Reset (0x2C) logic, allowing for ultra-low power wake-up events.                                                                                                                                                                     |
| **Pin Configuration**  | **FULL**  | Integrated `HBN_PAD_CTRL_0/1` (0x38-0x3C) for AON-domain GPIO (9-15, 40-41) control, including Hardware Pull-Up/Down and Isolation (Retention) modes.                                                                                                                                   |
| **Clock Management**   | **FULL**  | Added complete RC32K (Internal) and XTAL32K (External) oscillator management including calibration blocks (0x200-0x20C).                                                                                                                                                               |
| **Reset Values**       | **FULL**  | All reset values (e.g., LDO voltages default to 0xA, RC32K code defaults) were synchronized with the hardware header structural defaults.                                                                                                                                               |
-->
